    "requestText": "Approve only the Knowledge Wiki internal verifier child protocol, independent trust provisioning descriptor, learning evidence artifacts and project knowledge journal changes specified below, plus the necessary narrow user-triggered trial entry point. Keep all existing public method shapes and core Session/ToolRuntime/LLM provider contracts. Any additive trial method is separately named and bounded; no model-facing caller may submit pass/fail, counts, evaluator keys or unsigned trial grants. Record the approved affected-node plan/data-format baseline before implementation; do not silently rewrite the current immutable manifest.",
